            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26078826?u=9388a2c2a0f1ca2799a4fd23f3e060c353d6ac37&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fix typo <code class=\"notranslate\">Scx</code>-&gt;<code class=\"notranslate\">scx</code> for short name of <code class=\"notranslate\">Script_Extensions</code> prop.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Scx</code> capitalization is invalid, must be <code class=\"notranslate\">scx</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"/\\p{scx=Thaana}/u // ok\n/\\p{Scx=Thaana}/u // Uncaught SyntaxError: Invalid regular expression: /\\p{Scx=Thaana}/u: Invalid property name\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-pds\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">/</span><span class=\"pl-cce\">\\p<span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>scx<span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span>Thaana<span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></span><span class=\"pl-c1\">/</span>u</span> <span class=\"pl-c\">// ok</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">/</span>\\p<span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>Scx<span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span><span class=\"pl-v\">Thaana</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">/</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">u</span> <span class=\"pl-c\">// Uncaught SyntaxError: Invalid regular expression: /\\p{Scx=Thaana}/u: Invalid property name</span></pre></div>",
