        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/432915?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The bit in <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/PasswordCredential/PasswordCredential\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/PasswordCredential/PasswordCredential</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In supporting browsers, an instance of this class may be passed the credential from the init object for global <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/fetch\" rel=\"nofollow\">fetch()</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">...as far as we can tell makes no sense.</p>",
