        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Our HTML DOM docs are supposed to be thin because the HTML docs are the source of truth for everything about these attributes. The IDL merely reflects the attributes but adds no additional semantics.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #26560.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1694492761\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/26560\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/26560/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/26560\">#26560</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #27291.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1754285063\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/27291\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/27291/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/27291\">#27291</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #35492.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2471571780\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/35492\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/35492/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/35492\">#35492</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #38897.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2961708567\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38897\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/38897/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38897\">#38897</a></li>\n</ul>",
